{"parse": {"title": "火星印", "pageid": 22197, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"火星印\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a0/CurrencyItem-1050701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"火星印\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>火星印</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#1515</div></div><hr /><div>乌卢鲁运动会官方特供的志愿者印章，完成委托后获得，积累可兑换酬劳。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">火星静默、聚集，而后构成火种，点燃伟岸的大地。夜空下，每一粒火星都耀眼如明星。\n至此，为每一位坚守职责的志愿者，献上最为崇高的敬意。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "火星印"}}